morgan: Updated per-request vs per-token examples and added a tiny table (inline markdown). Also included a sample curl for extracting the quota header:

```bash
curl -i -H "Authorization: Bearer $REDWOOD_KEY" "https://api.redwood.ai/v1/usage" | grep -i x-redwood-quota-remaining
```

